Description:
Built around the room, not the other way around.

@foresightsports Falcon, custom vinyl pads and a dual-screen setup designed to work with the existing space and railings.

📍Newtown Square, PA

Built for the way college golfers actually train ⛳️

This custom facility for Illinois State brings the building, technology and training experience together in one space.

Working with our partner First Galena, we helped with the full building design and exterior facade to complement the existing structures, then built out the performance side with:

@foresightsports QUADs
@gaspsystems dual force plates
Custom dual-screen systems
@swingcatalyst cameras
Custom vinyl pads
Keypad automation

A pretty incredible setup for the Redbirds. College golfers: what are you using first? 👇
